<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Credicorp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Credicorp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment analysts Laura Berdeja and Andrew Marshall have raised their rating on Peru's Credicorp Ltd to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>In a July 17 report, they said the upgrade reflected recent underperformance in the share price.</p>
<p>-- They set a target price of $25.80 on the American Depositary Receipts.</p>
<p>-- The ADRs were off 1-1/16 to 19-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
